<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>数据库 on Pi3's Notes</title><link>https://blog.pi3.fun/tags/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/</link><description>Recent content in 数据库 on Pi3's Notes</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>622.511.liuchao@gmail.com (LiuChao)</managingEditor><webMaster>622.511.liuchao@gmail.com (LiuChao)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.pi3.fun/tags/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>数据库在线无感迁移</title><link>https://blog.pi3.fun/post/2026/09/1788433875/</link><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>622.511.liuchao@gmail.com (LiuChao)</author><guid>https://blog.pi3.fun/post/2026/09/1788433875/</guid><description>&lt;p>在线无感迁移要解决三件事：业务不停机、数据不丢失、出问题能回滚。标准实现可以概括为一句话：&lt;strong>全量迁移 + 增量同步 + 灰度切流&lt;/strong>。先分批迁走历史数据，再用 binlog 等增量同步手段补齐全量期间产生的新数据，最后把流量逐步从旧库切到新库。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>